WEBVTT

00:00:00.729 --> 00:00:01.977
At the sales review,

00:00:02.015 --> 00:00:04.156
the question is where to look next.

00:00:04.449 --> 00:00:08.908
In Sundae, start in Revenue Intelligence and
check the selected

00:00:08.985 --> 00:00:12.031
outlet and period. Open Daypart.

00:00:12.247 --> 00:00:15.967
Here, breakfast, lunch and dinner appear
together,

00:00:16.146 --> 00:00:18.261
so you can compare the sales mix.

00:00:18.605 --> 00:00:21.637
Scroll down to Revenue Opportunity Slots.

00:00:22.032 --> 00:00:24.798
In this demonstration, five p.m.

00:00:24.823 --> 00:00:27.320
has the largest estimated gap.

00:00:27.664 --> 00:00:29.919
That is a signal to investigate.

00:00:30.212 --> 00:00:33.015
The manager can test a focused change,

00:00:33.232 --> 00:00:37.093
then return to the same view for the next
comparable period.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:38.500
Sundae.

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:40.900
See every layer, act in time.
